FL,397,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39602
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F396A1786915123
OL,3,CTide returns to marsh for first time
OL,4,Cin 200 years following restoration
OL,5,Cworks
OL,7,FThe Greatham Marsh Restoration Scheme
OL,8,Fby the Environment Agency,
OL,9,FNorthumbrian Water and the Greatham
OL,10,FFoundation is part of the wider #30m
OL,11,FTees Tidelands Programme, which aims
OL,12,Fto update flood defences, restore
OL,13,Fhabitats, and reconnect tributaries
OL,14,Fand local communities with the estuary.
OL,16,FGraeme Hull from the Environment
OL,17,FAgency told ITV News Tyne Tees: "The
OL,18,Fsalt marsh that it'll form can reduce
OL,19,Fnutrients, so that's a big problem for
OL,20,Fthe Tees Estuary, there's too much.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G2/8
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,397,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F396A1786915123
OL,3,CTide returns to marsh for first time
OL,4,Cin 200 years following restoration
OL,5,Cworks
OL,7,F"It'll reduce carbon as well, and it
OL,8,Fwill allow us to focus our limited
OL,9,Fresources on the defences that we need
OL,10,Fto maintain and build.
OL,12,F"Where we can realign them, we can
OL,13,Frestore intertidal habitats, which
OL,14,Fwe've lost 90 per cent of the
OL,15,Fintertidal habitats on the Tees
OL,16,FEstuary, and then we can reconnect
OL,17,Ftributaries ecologically with the
OL,18,Festuary, so it allows migratory fish
OL,19,Fto come for the first time in 46
OL,20,Fyears."
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G3/8
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,397,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39604
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F396A1786915123
OL,3,CTide returns to marsh for first time
OL,4,Cin 200 years following restoration
OL,5,Cworks
OL,7,FThe project has seen the beck restored
OL,8,Fto its original course, which was
OL,9,Ffilled in about 50 years ago.
OL,11,FOld sections of the flood banks and a
OL,12,Ftidal sluice have been removed. It is
OL,13,Fhoped it will enable the coastal salt
OL,14,Fmarsh to return to its more natural
OL,15,Fcourse, in turn providing valuable
OL,16,Fwetland habitats for wildlife.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G4/8
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,397,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39605
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F396A1786915123
OL,3,CTide returns to marsh for first time
OL,4,Cin 200 years following restoration
OL,5,Cworks
OL,7,FThe work will enable restoration of
OL,8,Fmore than 20 hectares of coastal salt
OL,9,Fmarsh, mudflats, and high tide roosts,
OL,10,Fproviding crucial habitat for
OL,11,Finternationally important species
OL,12,Fincluding curlews and avocets.
OL,14,FMargaret Bousfield from the Greatham
OL,15,FFoundation, which supports older
OL,16,Fpeople and dementia patients in the
OL,17,Farea and was a driving force behind
OL,18,Fthe project, has high hopes for the
OL,19,Fsite.
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G5/8
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,397,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39606
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F396A1786915123
OL,3,CTide returns to marsh for first time
OL,4,Cin 200 years following restoration
OL,5,Cworks
OL,7,FShe said: "When you see how popular
OL,8,FSaltholme is, we're hoping that we'll
OL,9,Fhave exactly the same as them, which
OL,10,Fwill be seals, fish, the birdlife. I'm
OL,11,Fsure (it) will be absolutely
OL,12,Ftremendous, so from a bit of
OL,13,Fagricultural land, the benefits really
OL,14,Fare enormous."
OL,16,FThe restoration will also improve
OL,17,Fwater quality and strengthen the
OL,18,Farea's resilience to climate change
OL,19,Fand sea level rise.
OL,26,@sD@FpmsD@Ipn
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G6/8
OL,2,W/*%+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNE Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,397,390,120,260,000,100
PN,39607
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F396A1786915123
OL,3,CTide returns to marsh for first time
OL,4,Cin 200 years following restoration
OL,5,Cworks
OL,7,FLaura Mollon from Northumbrian Water
OL,8,Fsaid: "Basically it (realigning flood
OL,9,Fdefences) allows the tide to flood the
OL,10,Fareas as it naturally would have, and
OL,11,Fthat then prevents flooding
OL,12,Fproperties, which are further
OL,13,Fdownstream and along those estuary
OL,14,Fedges, because it allows the water to
OL,15,Fmove up into areas where it'll have a
OL,16,Fbenefit and no impact."
OL,18,FAfter construction, native hedgerows
OL,19,Fand trees will be planted. Nearly a
OL,20,Fdozen hectares of grassland will also
OL,21,Fbe sown.
OL,26,@pD@UpmqD@Ipn
OL,1,W~k4~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}        G7/8
